cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use kaphtor, please cite it as below."
title: "kaphtor: tools and data for Linear A research and comparative Semitics"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "di Mino"
    given-names: "Tom"
abstract: >-
  An open record of Linear A, and a toolkit for comparative Semitics: a reconciled record of the Linear A
  inscriptions, proposed readings for their words and signs with their evidence and confidence tiers, tools for
  testing those readings against the corpus, a database of Semitic roots, and query tools for the corpora of the
  ancient Near East.
keywords:
  - Linear A
  - Minoan
  - Aegean scripts
  - decipherment
  - Semitic languages
  - comparative Semitics
  - ancient Near East
  - epigraphy
  - Crete
repository-code: "https://github.com/plasma-ai/kaphtor"
